@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Report Details

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Read-only view of one report version (any type) with its
status, reviewer decision and link to the previous version.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports/Details/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load the TenderReport by id with Documents; check the
  Officer owns the tender.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, Documents.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required report lifecycle step (spec §4.4, §4.6, §11); no
Trello card covers it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Report Details";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "One report version exactly as it was submitted, with its review decision.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Report version</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Tender / round</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Report type</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Version</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Created by</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Submitted</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Previous version</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Review decision</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Reviewed by</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Decision</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Comment</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Reviewed at (UTC)</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Content</h2>
    <partial name="_EmptyState" model='"Report content is not loaded."' />
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-attachments">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-attachments">Attachments</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Document</th><th scope="col">Uploaded</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No attachments."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="History">Report versions</a></li>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Index">All reports</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
